# OnRoad (vehicle sales & on-road quotes)

`project_tracker: github`

## What this is

Next.js monolith for Vietnam vehicle catalog and location-based on-road cost quotes. App lives in `web/`; Neon PostgreSQL is the database.

## Run

| Command | Effect |
|---|---|
| `npm run dev` or `npm start` (repo root) | Next.js on `:3000` (`web/`) |
| `npm run dev` (from `web/`) | Same — local development |
| `npm run build && npm start` (from `web/`) | Production server (needs a complete `.next` build) |

Do not expect a Vite `:5173` or Spring Boot `:8002` process. There is no `frontend/` + `backend/` split.

## Stack

- **App:** Next.js 16 App Router, React 19, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS v4 (`web/`)
- **API:** Next.js route handlers under `web/src/app/api/`
- **Database:** Neon PostgreSQL via Drizzle (`web/src/server/db/`)

